                                                "sense_id": "75d34d7c-10c9-3358-b4b8-e9d05550a1cf",
                                                "text": "It recalled all the vivid hopes and beliefs of her childhood, when she was wont to kneel before some lovely image, till the face seemed to smile encouragement, and the little supplicant felt as if beneath a mother's eye."
